<metadata><name>Offshore 160 Singlehanded Challenge 2026</name><desc>2026 Offshore 160 Singlehanded Challenge (Newport YC, Jul 10-12, 2026). Source: Sailing Instructions with Amendment 1 (classes may sail different courses) and Amendment 2 (rounding sides: R4 off Block Island and both virtual marks to port, R2 off Pt Judith to starboard) applied. Start (SI 7.1): line between RC boat and an orange inflatable W of Goat Island, between Fort Adams and Rose Island - drawn at an approximate point. Finish (SI 13): at R2 Brenton Reef; each yacht takes her own GPS time when R2 bears 110 magnetic at a distance not exceeding 1/2 mile (bearing line drawn using 13.8 W variation). R4 position is the lat/long printed in the SI (Light List 19735); virtual marks as printed; R2 Pt Judith is Light List 19460. Cox Ledge Exclusion Zone (SI 6.4, Appendix A, seven virtual boundary marks EZ01-EZ07) is an obstruction: do not enter. Points named (routing) are not marks; either side of Block Island is allowed on the way to R4 - drawn W of the island.</desc></metadata>
